  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SRK/IFRC 2013 and amendment for support to        Strategic Research into National and Local        Capacity Building for Disaster Risk Management - SRK/IFRC 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SRK/IFRC 2013 samt till&#xe4;ggsbeslut f&#xf6;r st&#xf6;d till   Strategic Research into National and Local        Capacity Building for Disaster Risk Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till SRK:s l&#xe5;ngsiktiga humanit&#xe4;ra arbete med lokal               kapacitetsutveckling &quot;Att bygga motst&#xe5;ndskraftiga samh&#xe4;llen&quot; f&#xf6;r att  under 2013 forts&#xe4;tta arbetet med att st&#xe4;rka den humanit&#xe4;ra            kapaciteten bland ett flertal nationella R&#xf6;da Kors- och R&#xf6;da          Halvm&#xe5;nef&#xf6;reningar i fr&#xe4;mst 14 l&#xe4;nder.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for SRC&apos;s long-term humanitarian work with local capacity     building &quot;Building resilient communities&quot; during 2013 to continue     efforts to strengthen the humanitarian capacity among several         national Red Cross and Red Crescent Societies,primarily in 14         countries.</narrative>
  </description>
